# Task #135 — the Smart Pro 2026-07-03 field case, launch-card-v2 shape: rev 471 (RG34XX)
# wears the row-level CURRENT tag because the coexist TWIN's save file holds those bytes,
# but the save the LAUNCHED file will load matches only the OLDER rev 467. STRICT: the
# LOCAL= trailer is the gate — the card (shown every launch) presents the LOCAL=older news
# engine-side. The hook must NOT re-derive anything from the CURRENT tag.
desc fetch hook: newest row CURRENT via the twin's save but LOCAL=older -> wizard handoff fires (Smart Pro field case)
invoke prehook
config paired
romarg Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Emerald.gba
sdfile+ Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Emerald.gba
engine 0|471\t2026-07-02 14:28\tRG34XX\t128KB\tCURRENT\n467\t2026-07-02 04:28\tRG Rotate\t128KB\nLOCAL=older
wizard 0|LAUNCHCARD mode=summoned shown=1 action=play evicted=0
expect_exit 0
expect_trace WIZARD --launch-card --summoned
expect_trace ✓ Emerald.gba => rc=0
expect_trace_absent LIST[
expect_trace_absent ENGINE --restore-save
expect_log local=older action=card
